Use current Catch2 3.16.1 for the upstream OSQP test harness.

Update the aggregate header and custom CLI namespace. Keep the existing
Approx assertions through an explicit import in the shared test header.
The solver, numerical inputs, tolerances and test selection do not change.
Original AI-assisted EmberBSD change; not submitted upstream. OSQP retains
its Apache-2.0 license. Catch2 remains a test-only dependency under BSL-1.0.

